   "offered_by": {
    "allegiance": "codex/space_wolves/allegiances/allegiance_space_wolves"
   },
   "text": "Restrictions:\n\n- Your Warlord must include at least 1 Theiygn Battle Leader upgraded to be a Jarl.\n- Your army must include at least 1 Bloodclaws unit and 1 Grey Hunter unit.\n- Your army must include at least 1 Theiygn Guard unit.\n\nBenefits:\n\n- All Space Wolves Infantry type units gain the Outflank special rule.\n- Theiygn Guard units in your army do not take up a Force Organization Slot.\n- Your Warlord may purchase one of the following if they do not have the Unique Keyword:\n    - Saga of the Warrior Born for 5pts.\n    - Saga of the Bear for 5pts.\n    - Saga of Majesty for 5pts.\n    - Saga of the Hunter for 10pts.\n    - Saga of the Wolfkin for 5pts.\n    - Saga of the Beast Slayer for 10pts.",
