   },
   "text": "Restrictions:\n\n- Your army may not include Bloodclaws.\n- Your army may not include Grey Hunters.\n- Your army must include at least 1 unit of Wolf Scouts.\n- Your army must include at least 2 units of Hounds of Morkai.\n\nBenefits:\n\n- You may field Hounds of Morkai as Troops choices.\n- You may field Swiftclaws as Troops choices but gain the Support Squad special rule.\n- Your Warlord may exchange their Power Armour for:\n    - Scout Armour for 5pts.\n    - Phobos Armour for 10pts.\n- Any model in your army may exchange their:\n    - Bolt Pistol for a Morkai Bolt Pistol for 1pts.\n    - Boltgun for Morkai Boltgun for 1pt.",
   "restrictions": [
    {
     "id": "no_bloodclaws",
     "printed": "Your army may not include Bloodclaws.",
     "scope": "detachment",
